      "id": "26e95dfbb073-q9",
      "number": 9,
      "question": "Instruction: Identify the assumptions that must hold for the statement to be valid, then choose the correct option. Statement: Despite current efforts toward carbon neutrality, global corporate policies must undergo a fundamental shift to avoid an irreversible climate crisis. Assumptions: I. Current efforts are insufficient to prevent a climate crisis. II. Corporate policies have a significant impact on global carbon levels. III. A fundamental shift in policy can still prevent the crisis.",
      "questionHtml": "Instruction: Identify the assumptions that must hold for the statement to be valid, then choose the correct option.<br />\n<br />\nStatement: Despite current efforts toward carbon neutrality, global corporate policies must undergo a fundamental shift to avoid an irreversible climate crisis.<br />\n<br />\nAssumptions: I. Current efforts are insufficient to prevent a climate crisis.<br />\n<br />\nII. Corporate policies have a significant impact on global carbon levels.<br />\n<br />\nIII. A fundamental shift in policy can still prevent the crisis.",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "Only I and II are implicit",
          "html": "Only I and II are implicit"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "Only I is implicit",
          "html": "Only I is implicit"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "All are implicit",
          "html": "All are implicit"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "Only II and III are implicit",
          "html": "Only II and III are implicit"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">I. Current efforts are insufficient to prevent a climate crisis →  <span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Implicit </span>(by “despite current efforts” and the need for a <em data-end=\"388\" data-start=\"369\">fundamental shift</em>.)</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">II. Corporate policies have a significant impact on global carbon levels →   <span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Implicit </span>(because the statement focuses specifically on changing <span data-end=\"575\" data-start=\"553\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">corporate policies</span> to address the crisis.)</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">III. A fundamental shift in policy can still prevent the crisis →  <span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Implicit </span>(otherwise, calling for a shift “to avoid” an irreversible crisis would be meaningless.)</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Here, <span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">All are implicit. </span></p>\n",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
    {
      "id": "26e95dfbb073-q10",
      "number": 10,
      "question": "Read the following statement carefully and identify the conclusion that follows. Statement: The health department has mandated that all packaged foods must display clear nutritional labels. Conclusions: I. Consumers are now required to read labels before purchasing food. II. Some packaged foods did not have clear nutritional labels previously.",
      "questionHtml": "Read the following statement carefully and identify the conclusion that follows.<br />\n<br />\nStatement: The health department has mandated that all packaged foods must display clear nutritional labels.<br />\n<br />\nConclusions: I. Consumers are now required to read labels before purchasing food.<br />\n<br />\nII. Some packaged foods did not have clear nutritional labels previously.",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "Only Conclusion I follows",
          "html": "Only Conclusion I follows"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "Only Conclusion II follows",
          "html": "Only Conclusion II follows"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "Both I and II follow",
          "html": "Both I and II follow"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "Neither I nor II follows",
          "html": "Neither I nor II follows"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">I. Consumers are now required to read labels before purchasing food  →  <span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">False</span><span style=\"font-weight: 700;\"> </span>(The mandate is on <span data-end=\"337\" data-start=\"315\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">food manufacturers</span>, not on consumers. There is no requirement stated about consumers’ behavior.)</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">II. Some packaged foods did not have clear nutritional labels previously →   <span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">True </span>(If a mandate is introduced, it implies that earlier the situation was <span data-end=\"640\" data-start=\"617\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">not fully compliant</span>, otherwise the mandate would be unnecessary.)</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Here, <span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Only Conclusion II follows.</span></p>\n",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
