      "question": "Arrange the following historical eras in chronological order: 1. Space Age 2. Bronze Age 3. Middle Ages 4. Neolithic Era 5. Industrial Age",
      "questionHtml": "Arrange the following historical eras in chronological order:<br />\n<br />\n1. Space Age<br />\n<br />\n2. Bronze Age<br />\n<br />\n3. Middle Ages<br />\n<br />\n4. Neolithic Era<br />\n<br />\n5. Industrial Age",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "4, 2, 3, 5, 1",
          "html": "4, 2, 3, 5, 1"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "4, 3, 2, 5, 1",
          "html": "4, 3, 2, 5, 1"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "2, 4, 3, 5, 1",
          "html": "2, 4, 3, 5, 1"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "5, 4, 3, 2, 1",
          "html": "5, 4, 3, 2, 1"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p data-end=\"51\" data-start=\"0\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Arrangement of the eras from <span data-end=\"50\" data-start=\"28\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">earliest to latest</span>:</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"111\" data-start=\"55\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span data-end=\"72\" data-start=\"55\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Neolithic Era</span> , <span data-end=\"128\" data-start=\"114\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Bronze Age</span> , <span data-end=\"194\" data-start=\"179\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Middle Ages</span> , <span data-end=\"235\" data-start=\"217\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Industrial Age</span> , <span data-end=\"286\" data-start=\"273\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Space Age</span> </p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Thus, the correct chronological order is: <span data-end=\"371\" data-start=\"354\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">4, 2, 3, 5, 1</span></p>\n",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
