      "id": "26e95dfbb073-q18",
      "number": 18,
      "question": "Comprehension: In a specific coding system, there are only two symbols used to represent numbers: Square and Circle. 0 is represented by Square and 1 by Circle. Subsequent numbers are represented as follows: 2 is Circle-Square, 3 is Circle-Circle, 4 is Circle-Square-Square, and so on. How will you represent the number 42 in this system?",
      "questionHtml": "Comprehension: In a specific coding system, there are only two symbols used to represent numbers: Square and Circle. 0 is represented by Square and 1 by Circle. Subsequent numbers are represented as follows: 2 is Circle-Square, 3 is Circle-Circle, 4 is Circle-Square-Square, and so on.<br />\n<br />\nHow will you represent the number 42 in this system?",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "Circle-Square-Circle-Square-Circle-Square",
          "html": "Circle-Square-Circle-Square-Circle-Square"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "Circle-Square-Square-Circle-Square-Circle",
          "html": "Circle-Square-Square-Circle-Square-Circle"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "Circle-Circle-Square-Square-Circle-Square",
          "html": "Circle-Circle-Square-Square-Circle-Square"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "Circle-Square-Circle-Square-Square-Circle",
          "html": "Circle-Square-Circle-Square-Square-Circle"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p data-end=\"233\" data-start=\"197\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Logic:  </span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">This coding system is simply </span><span data-end=\"54\" data-start=\"29\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">binary representation</span><span style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\"> using symbols: </span><span data-end=\"87\" data-start=\"73\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Square = 0,  </span><span data-end=\"104\" data-start=\"90\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Circle = 1.</span></p>\n\n<p data-end=\"233\" data-start=\"197\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Converting 42 to binary number: <span class=\"base\"><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; bottom: -0.25em;font-size:10.5px;\"><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\"><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">10</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"mord\">10101</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span style=\"position: relative;  line-height: 0; vertical-align: baseline; bottom: -0.25em;font-size:10.5px;\"><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\"><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n\n<p data-end=\"361\" data-start=\"349\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Replacing: 1 → Circle and  0 → Square</p>\n\n<p data-end=\"401\" data-start=\"378\" style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">So, <span data-end=\"392\" data-start=\"382\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">101010</span> becomes: <span data-end=\"458\" data-start=\"403\" style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">Circle – Square – Circle – Square – Circle – Square</span></p>\n",
      "images": [],
      "subject": null,
      "topic": null,
      "difficulty": null
    },
