      "question": "A principal amount of 2,000 yields a simple interest of 400 over a period of 2 years. What is the annual interest rate?",
      "questionHtml": "A principal amount of 2,000 yields a simple interest of 400 over a period of 2 years. What is the annual interest rate?",
      "options": [
