          "text": "15 percent",
          "html": "15 percent"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "B",
      "solution": "<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Simple Intrest = P x R x T / 100</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">⇒ 400 = 2000 x R x 2 / 100</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">⇒ 400 = 4000 x R  / 100</p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">⇒ 400 x 100  = 4000 x R  </p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">⇒ 40000 / 4000  =  R  </p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">⇒ 10 =  R </p>\n\n<p style=\"color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Thus, The rate of interest will be <span style=\"font-weight: bolder;\">10.</span></p>\n",
